# One major gap I independently confirmed

Your competitor document is **not empty or weak**. It covers 80+ vendors and even includes modern AI voice companies such as Retell, Vapi, Bland, Synthflow, ElevenLabs, LiveKit and others.

But you're right about the deeper missing competitor.

It still models competition mainly like:

```text
