    vs
Existing SaaS Product A
Existing SaaS Product B
Existing SaaS Product C
```

The new competitive model also has to include:

```text
                    BUYER'S CHOICE
                         │
       ┌─────────────────┼──────────────────┐
       ▼                 ▼                  ▼
 Buy TalkProof      Buy competitor      BUILD IT
                                           │
                          ┌────────────────┼───────────────┐
                          ▼                ▼               ▼
