The existing Sprint Tracker is an AUDIT RECORD.

Do not clean it.

Do not rewrite old sprint history to make today's understanding appear to have existed earlier.

Do not remove completed, open or planned sprints.

Do not reorder existing sprint numbers.

If an old sprint was incorrectly considered DONE, preserve that historical status and record the newly discovered gap separately.

